    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Roads</strong> is a casual driving game all about finding peace in a long, scenic journey, with no objective but to see what's around the next corner. Escape to endless, procedurally-generated landscapes with configurable roads, seasons, weathers, and vehicles. Generate a world, set the weather to suit your mood, and <strong>just drive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless driving zen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/626f32e6d73e703b5b0810c5c0c0dc8e.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek peace through active meditation - chase the horizon through rolling scenery that never ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Organic roads without repetition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/862ca065ad63b50eb1a2883452047c62.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A novel procedural engine generates the landscapes and roads organically, meaning <strong>every road you generate is unique</strong>, and no two corners are alike. This generation is seeded, allowing you curate worlds and share your favourite roads with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your vibe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/c5f4aca310f969817e963ff207867779.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly switch between seasons, weathers, locations, road style, vehicles to suit your mood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adjust your seat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/8a2ff0606595d43c7e44b581352e53b3.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sim enthusiasts can enjoy a fully-configurable cockpit view and support for controller and wheel input*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just drive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/51f2f38a39a74213b58f7039231cf760.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free yourself from objectives and pressure; simply soak in the views at your own pace \u2014 or take a back seat and let the car drive for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam-exclusive features<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/b0562609c3e020abb230a05855f2c4b0.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the web-based version will remain freely accessible, by purchasing on Steam you help to support future development and gain the benefit of additional features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded vehicle configuration and customisation, including combustion engines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scene editing tool which helps you to craft your ideal road</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profiles for saving your progress and worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded gameplay and graphics settings, including post-processing effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added scenery details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-definition assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements and optional challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Steam version is also planned to receive the following exclusive updates in future:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer game modes</strong> for shared drives or competitive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to <strong>extra locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to a <strong>broader range of vehicles</strong>,<strong>\u00a0</strong>including combustion engines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced graphics features such as <strong>post-processing effects</strong> and <strong>added environmental detail</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active independent development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow Roads is a living project with new features, locations, and vehicles in continuous development. The roadmap is long, but the upcoming priorities are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New locations, featuring mountains, oceans, tunnels, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More vehicles, with improved physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved graphics features for lighting, weather, and environmental detail</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Force feedback support is targeted for release but remains in experimental development, so cannot be guaranteed at this time</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Roads</strong> is a casual driving game all about finding peace in a long, scenic journey, with no objective but to see what's around the next corner. Escape to endless, procedurally-generated landscapes with configurable roads, seasons, weathers, and vehicles. Generate a world, set the weather to suit your mood, and <strong>just drive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless driving zen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/626f32e6d73e703b5b0810c5c0c0dc8e.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek peace through active meditation - chase the horizon through rolling scenery that never ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Organic roads without repetition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/862ca065ad63b50eb1a2883452047c62.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A novel procedural engine generates the landscapes and roads organically, meaning <strong>every road you generate is unique</strong>, and no two corners are alike. This generation is seeded, allowing you curate worlds and share your favourite roads with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your vibe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431300/extras/c5f4aca310f969817e963ff207867779.avif?t=1754507253\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly switch between seasons, weathers, locations, road style, vehicles to suit your mood</p><p class=\